sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant U as User
  participant M as Main thread
  participant S as Scheduler
  participant W as Web Worker

  U->>M: drop or pick files
  M->>M: detect MIME + extension, resolve tool
  M->>S: enqueue job
  S->>S: capacity check (RAM ≥ 8 GB, ≥ 4 cores)

  alt capacity available
    S->>W: postMessage (transfer ArrayBuffer)
  else low-end or mobile
    S->>S: wait for the previous job
    S->>W: postMessage (one at a time)
  end

  W-->>M: progress
  M-->>U: progress bar
  W-->>S: done (Blob)
  S-->>M: release slot
  M-->>U: download or ZIP
  Note over M,W: CSP connect-src 'self' — nothing leaves the page
